<name>Bleeding disorder, platelet-type, 24</name>
<acronym>BDPLT24</acronym>
<description>An autosomal dominant disorder of platelet production characterized by congenital macrothrombocytopenia and platelet anisocytosis. Affected individuals may have no or only mildly increased bleeding tendency.</description>
<dbReference type="MIM" id="619271"/>
</disease>
<text>The disease is caused by variants affecting the gene represented in this entry.</text>
